<title>USA: Goldman details upgrade of Estee Lauder.</title>
<headline>Goldman details upgrade of Estee Lauder.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs analyst Amy Low said on Tuesday her firm put Estee Lauder on its priority list because it is &quot;unique&quot; within its category.</p>
<p>&quot;They dominate the prestige cosmetics industry,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>Low said Estee Lauder was raised to the priority list from the recommended list because it steadily has been gaining market share and its margins are rising.</p>
<p>Low said she had not made other changes in her recommendation or rating of the stock.</p>
<p>&quot;There hasn't really been a change in the fundamentals,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>Estee Lauder shares rose 3-1/2 to 51-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Patricia Willens, 212-859-1727</p>
</text>
